Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(sim): a new block on another machine is judged, not
 refused

Review on #411: the machine check ran before the entry was chosen,
so it refused Entry::NewBlock too. It now runs where material crosses:
carry_turn and the Clip arm.

Refs #404

